WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.430
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.570
Check it!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:10.740
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.000
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.870
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:37.540
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.170
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.610
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:50.320
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:53.650
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:56.160
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.460
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.490
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.030
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:05.830
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.470
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:11.570
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:15.080
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:18.580
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.980
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:25.750
Fly up, angel

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.530
Preparing link-up!

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.030
Alright! Get on!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.990
Who are you?!

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:43.300
That guy you shot was my brother!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.460
I'm his younger twin, Liang!

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:53.840
Why all this ruckus
for just one lousy bum?!

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:58.510
Hinode Pharmaceuticals was
secretly doing experiments

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:01.770
involving human bodies
at its Shinagawa factory.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:06.540
There's a good chance Wong
was one of their samples.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:10.660
It's likely that RAPT is also involved.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:13.420
That's all I know for now.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.130
Found it!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:19.460
It's beneath Tokyo Terminal,
connected to a freight train!

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.830
--Destination?
--It's heading north!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:25.130
--We gonna chase it?
--You bet we are!

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:41.520
Be honest. Hinode Pharmaceuticals
hired you, didn't they?

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:44.590
Hinode Pharmaceuticals?
What are you talking about?

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.290
--Quit lying!
--I'm not lying!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:51.160
We were only asked
to find that old man!

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.300
Shoot if you want!

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:57.100
I'll jump off and take you with me!

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:11.710
Liang, right?
What are you trying to do?

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.750
I want my brother back. That's all.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:20.820
That old crackpot?

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:28.990
I'll admit, he is human rubbish.
But he wasn't always that way.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:35.500
He's the reason I was even able
to open a restaurant in this country.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.530
<i>Yo! Get good business today?</i>

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:45.340
<i>Perfect timing. Bet you're hungry, huh?</i>

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:50.720
<i>It's great! Your fried rice
is really great!</i>

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:55.350
<i>If you want my fried rice,
then don't do anything too rash.</i>

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:02.630
<i>Don't worry about me! I still
plan to earn a lot in this town!</i>

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:09.310
But one day, he caused some trouble
and RAPT took him in.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:14.640
When he returned, he was
no longer the brother I knew.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.210
Brother! What's wrong?!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.820
He used to hate pills,
but now he took some everyday.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.960
Said they were really good vitamins,

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:33.660
but it was too late
once I realized the truth!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:44.170
I was worried about him, so I started
looking into what happened.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:49.480
The person he bought the pills
from was a RAPT pawn.

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:53.710
They put on an act
so he would want the drugs!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:58.760
It looked like they were
using his body to test something.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:02.060
I took his pills away to try to stop it,

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:05.220
but he disappeared after that.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.840
Hey, now. Today ain't the sale day.

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:17.980
You get 'em on specific days. Go home.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:23.280
--Please stop this...!
--What did you say?!

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:26.650
I'm asking you to
stop selling the pills!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:32.190
--Who do you think you are?!
--Stop...!

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:35.130
--Why are you doing this?!
--Shut up!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:39.260
Don't mess with me!
Anything else to say?!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.730
Stop it...!

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.600
Why, you...!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:51.480
Had I killed him right there,

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:54.250
my brother might not
have been taken away...!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:55.840
You scum...!

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:03.020
I learned that they took him
to a secret lab in Shinagawa

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:09.530
that processes experimental samples
for Hinode Pharmaceuticals.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.960
It appears they're after something
that's developed in his body...

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.960
Developed...?

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:22.140
--You're sure that's true?
--Assuming you trust Liang...

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:25.310
We're on our way. Stay there for now.

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.240
Got it.

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:32.980
--I'd like to get inside...
--You can't do that...!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:37.710
Wait! What're you doing?!

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:43.090
Gonna cut this cable and stop
the train inside the tunnel.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:46.260
It's dark inside.
I should be able to sneak in

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:48.900
while they're checking it out!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.890
Hold on there...!

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.570
Hey! You alright?!

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:03.210
D-Don't let go...!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.080
Yikes...!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.420
Oh no! My arm...!

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.150
Brother!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:48.650
Damn you! Turn him back to normal!

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.760
What're you doing?! That's terrible!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.890
Quiet! You wanna wind up the same way?!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:06.600
They recover test subjects
when the capsules' effects appear.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:12.120
Then, to get detailed data,
they take them to a proper facility.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.690
And then they move to an isolated area.

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:17.190
Bingo!

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:22.060
At the end of the track is a
Hinode drug development center!

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:28.500
<i>Did Bailan request Wong's protection
because they knew about this?</i>

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.630
<i>If so, were they after
his experimental data too?</i>

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:54.490
--We caught up to it!
--Amy! Contact Meg!

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.490
Is the center ready to receive him?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:02.490
They're ready. But he has even
stranger numbers than the last guy.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.260
I'll try adjusting
the regulator balance.

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:11.770
Now, of all times...!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.670
--What's that?
--Did you call for backup?

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:45.770
No, that's not Bailan.
It's someone else.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:50.110
There's only one thing
they could be after.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:55.180
<i>What exactly is hidden inside his body?!</i>

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.940
This is a warning! Stop the train

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:18.900
or we will remove
all crew members by force!

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:37.130
Presently, a Ratman is
fighting an enemy cybot

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.100
in the hangar of Car #3.

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:41.630
An enemy commando raid is expected;

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:46.090
medical staff is not to go outside.
That is all!

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:52.880
--What's going on?
--Things don't look so good.

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:55.510
Hey! No talking!

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:58.140
--What's your problem?
--I said shut your trap!

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:34.840
--Hell's about to break loose.
--Leave me some, too.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.110
Not good! Detach Car #3!

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:20.530
<i>Meg...!</i>

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:23.470
There any places ahead to
get off the Mega Highway?!

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:27.100
--Yeah, but why?
--I'm jumping onto it.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.710
Line up as close to
the train as you can!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:33.010
OK! Here goes!

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:42.520
I've never seen this before,
but the cellular structure is active.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:45.520
Could be a mutation to the second stage.

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:48.460
Let's increase the
solution's concentration.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:53.400
So this is the next guinea pig?
That's one ugly mug.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:56.870
The drugs are
especially strong this time.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:59.770
I look forward to the results.

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:17.750
What the hell...?!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:40.170
Enemy commandos eliminated.
Everything OK on your end?

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:44.680
What's going on? Respond!
Is anyone there?!

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:49.720
Brother...? Is that really you?!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:53.390
Don't be dumb!
He's not your brother anymore!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:56.380
Brother! Say something...!

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:00.400
Don't call out to him!
He'll come over here!

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:05.160
Brother! It's me, Liang!
Don't you remember me?!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.410
Li... ang...

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:13.070
Yes! It's me! You do remember me!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.340
What is that?!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.550
Bastard...!

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.550
Is this your doing, monster?!

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:27.220
--Let's dispose of him, Captain!
--Yes! He's a threat!

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.910
No, it's not what you think!
Don't misunderstand!

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:51.780
B-Brother...

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.220
This is bad!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:32.260
Like, this huge thing sprayed
lots of blood and stuff

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:37.660
and then Liang went splat
and then it went up front...!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.430
What are you trying to say?!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:43.800
Just help! Wong turned into
a monster and killed everyone

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.170
and now he's holed up
in the driver's seat!

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.760
So he's speeding up the train?!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.440
Jo! We can't do it!

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:08.190
Oh no! At this rate,
it's going to crash into the center!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:10.960
Wong is increasing its speed.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:13.660
He intends to die...!

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:23.870
He wants revenge on the guys
who turned him into a test subject...

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:27.070
No way! What about me?!

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:37.080
Heh... He really is a lost cause...
even until the end...

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.760
That's it! Lemme see that!

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:52.800
These are the last roads
that lead to the center.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.290
Zoom in on the intersection!

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:02.010
This isn't a road.
It's an old railroad bridge.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.650
What's it like underneath?

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:07.950
How should I know?
Satellite cameras only see from above.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.220
I should scrap that computer!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.390
Can you get ahead of it?

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:19.230
Somehow. But an old iron bridge
can't support the trailer.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:24.130
--What are you going to do?
--I have an idea.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.500
What?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.370
Move to the rear car! Right now!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.670
Got it!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:52.720
What the heck happened...?

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:57.790
Meg...!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:11.070
If you wanna go to Hell,
go by yourself!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.010
Now for our next story.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.810
A pet alligator named Claw-chan
attacked a West Azabu club

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:50.710
after escaping from the sewer system.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:55.720
One employee inside the club
was devoured and killed.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:21:00.660
History's youngest infant idol
has finally made his CD debut!

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:04.660
A translation chip was implanted
into the language center of--

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:06.220
Figures...

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:13.600
Meg! Eat this and cheer up!

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:15.110
What is this?

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:18.200
Kyohei-<i>oniichan's</i>
fried rice and dumplings!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.520
Twin brothers...

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:34.820
--Did you say something?
--No, it was nothing.

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:36.690
Down the hatch!

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:04.850
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:12.490
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:12.490 --> 00:22:20.200
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:29.580
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:36.120
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:45.190
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:52.230
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:15.920
<i>The remote school of
St. Luciana Academy.</i>

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:20.800
<i>The trap of an evil spirit catches Meg,
who snuck in alone.</i>

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:27.260
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"The Manor Where the Demon Lurks"
